  "gaps": [
    "MAT2010 (6 quarter credits) is listed as a required course under General Education Requirements; the totals only reach 180 if it counts within the 45-credit general education block, so the gen-ed block and MAT2010 must not be summed separately (remaining gen-ed choice is effectively 39 quarter credits, but the capture does not print that figure).",
    "This ledger follows the default path for students not required to take ACS1003. Students determined to need additional support must take ACS1003 Building Skills for Academic Success (6 quarter credits) in their first quarter, must take BUS2003 instead of BUS2007, and choose only 33 (not 39) elective quarter credits.",
    "Total requires a minimum of 54 quarter credits from the 3000-level and above; which electives/gen-ed courses satisfy this depends on student choices and is not itemized.",
    "General education category minimums (at least 4 quarter credits from each of Communication, Humanities, Natural Science and Mathematics, Social Science) are stated but specific course selections are student choice.",
    "Optional Honors Pathway (PHI-H2005 3, COM-H4005 6, SOC-H3005 6; at least 15 quarter credits applied toward general education) is not included in the default ledger.",
    "The capture does not state any residency or institutional-credit requirement (courses that must be completed at Capella) or transfer credit limits.",
    "The FlexPath option of this specialization (measured in program points) is not captured beyond its introduction and is not covered by this ledger.",
    "Course prerequisites are referenced to course descriptions not included in the capture."
  ],
